<title>CHINA: China Sanonda H1 net profits 61 mln yuan.</title>
<headline>China Sanonda H1 net profits 61 mln yuan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chinese pesticide maker Sanonda Co Ltd posted net profits of 61.20 million yuan for the first half of 1997, the Shenzhen Stock Exchange said on Monday.</p>
<p>Per-share net profits were 0.206 yuan and revenue was 470.66 million yuan in the first six months, the exchange said in a notice issued after the market closed.</p>
<p>It did not specify whether the results reflected Chinese or international accounting standards and no comparative figures were immediately available.</p>
<p>(US$1 = 8.3 yuan)</p>
</text>
